  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "(Added February 20, 2020)\nSorry! It was not because of the audio file, but because of the script I used to embed loop points to the wave file!\nSo, please fix the bug that invalid uploading is done by including a script not used in the scene, just in the project.\n\n(Original post)\nUnity's audio file looping feature is very poor. So, I embed the loop point in the wave file, made it into bgm, and uploaded the world, it says \"Successfully Uploaded!\", but nothing was uploaded. (When I entered the world, I was returned to the home world without loading anything)\nPerhaps VRChat does not support wave files with loop points. It is very convenient, so I'd like you to support it.\n\n",
